@theseOnAuthServer_HostAddress = https://localhost:7146

### Create an account
POST {{theseOnAuthServer_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "password": "a-long-example-password"
}

### Log in and issue an OpenIddict access token
POST {{theseOnAuthServer_HostAddress}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=theseOnAuthServer&username=alice&password=a-long-example-password&scope=openid%20profile
